1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,656
THIS SERIES IS A WORK OF FICTION
CREATED FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,616
ANY SIMILARITY OR RESEMBLANCE
TO ACTUAL PERSONS, LIVING OR DEAD

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,336
OR TO REAL ORGANIZATIONS, INSTITUTIONS
OR RELIGIOUS GROUPS IS ENTIRELY COINCIDENTAL

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,360
What?

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,160
You choked Nalin?

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,800
Delete it. Right now!

7
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,200
I did sleep with Non.

8
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:21,760
SteveJob123? Impossible! She's dead.

9
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,960
They said your sister had an affair

10
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,280
with a man she met at church.
Is that true?

11
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,920
Yes.

12
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,600
You must deny every accusation.

13
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,240
Insist you're innocent.

14
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,480
I'm going to do what's right.

15
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,320
- I won't drag God down with me.
- Chris!

16
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,880
I'll listen only to His voice.

17
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,320
The Council has summoned you.
What do you have to say?

18
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,080
I deny every accusation.

19
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:04,480
Since you deny the allegations,

20
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,840
the Council will appoint an inquiry committee
to investigate further

21
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:13,120
in accordance with its constitution.

22
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,080
To ensure fairness to all parties,

23
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:21,520
we ask that you temporarily step down

24
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,840
while the investigation is underway.

25
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,440
Heavenly Father,

26
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,680
what should I do?

27
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,520
Until now,

28
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:42,120
I thought staying silent
was the best way out.

29
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:43,920
Say it.

30
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,640
Tell me, Chris.

31
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,120
You chose to hide it

32
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,440
instead of caring about my feelings.

33
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,640
I thought that by not taking sides,

34
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,920
I could hold everything together.

35
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:05,960
But why…

36
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,560
the quieter I am, the louder everything gets?

37
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:14,760
I've watched two people I love

38
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:17,000
hurt each other right in front of me.

39
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:20,760
Today, I chose to protect the truth.

40
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,560
- I won't drag God down with me.
- Chris… Chris!

41
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,800
But I couldn't bring myself
to hurt my mother.

42
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:57,160
Please forgive me.

43
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:08,600
You want me to deal
with whoever has Chris's video?

44
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:12,120
Not by yourself. We have to work together.

45
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:16,800
You'd get all the benefits

46
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:20,080
while I put my neck on the line.

47
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,720
You're interfering with the investigation.

48
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:26,360
Chris took the DVR.

49
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:28,960
You erased all the footage from that night.

50
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,200
And there's Non's phone too.

51
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:34,160
I'm already in deep trouble, Mother.

52
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,880
You have a child too.

53
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,880
You should understand how a mother feels.

54
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:42,160
How is Chris supposed to live with it
if that video gets leaked?

55
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,520
I have a son too.

56
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:47,040
That's why I don't want to raise him
the way you raised Chris.

57
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:01,200
Just let the truth emerge on its own.

58
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,800
We've held it back long enough.

59
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:35,680
Hey, have you seen the leaked photos?

60
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,840
- What photos?
- Let me see.

61
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:37,880
That's Tuang's dad!

62
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,200
- Seriously?
- Yeah.

63
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:42,760
They're legit. And the woman's trans.

64
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,240
Whoa.

65
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,280
So Tuang's dad

66
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,720
likes going through the back door.

67
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,960
Ooh!

68
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:21,440
Tuang… Tuang. Tuangboon!

69
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:24,200
What's gotten into you? This isn't like you.

70
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,640
He was talking shit about Dad!

71
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,840
That doesn't give you the right to hit him.

72
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:30,360
So I'm supposed to just stand there
and take it?

73
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:33,400
You told me you could handle this.

74
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,640
I can handle it.

75
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:38,520
But I won't let them turn Dad into a joke!

76
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:46,280
It's his private life!
None of their business!

77
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:48,760
Now those photos have been leaked.

78
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,640
How long do I have to put up with this?

79
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:54,880
What if there's more?

80
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:56,760
Tuang!

81
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:15,000
I don't even want to live anymore, Mom.

82
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:29,480
I asked the podcast staff about Non's sister,

83
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:30,800
but they wouldn't tell me anything.

84
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,760
They said she's their source.

85
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:35,200
We still don't know who's behind this.

86
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:38,680
If you show your hand to the police too soon,

87
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:42,640
you could end up
sending Chris to prison yourself.

88
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:46,320
Honestly, I still haven't ruled Chris out.

89
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,440
But right now, I can't see who else,

90
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,720
besides Chris and his mom,

91
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,200
would want to kill Non.

92
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:54,360
So you want to start with the sister?

93
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:55,360
Yeah.

94
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:58,040
But there's more to it.

95
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:04,640
Hold on. How did you get these photo?

96
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,800
Listen. You're going too far.

97
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,000
You're crossing a lot of lines here, Tul.

98
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,320
Who's that?

99
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,600
Do you know Bua?

100
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,000
Bua?

101
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,440
Who's that? I don't know her.

102
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,480
Rueang's wife.

103
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:37,040
He was your driver
and right-hand man, Mother.

104
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,600
How is that relevant to me?

105
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:44,360
They had two children.

106
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,760
A girl and a boy.

107
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:50,160
This boy could be Non,

108
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:52,000
and the girl

109
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:55,360
is the woman from that podcast
claiming to be Non's sister.

110
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:59,760
Impossible. They all died in the fire.

111
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:11,176
If you're going to ask me about something
that happened so long ago…

112
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,640
I don't remember.

113
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,440
I'm old. I have Alzheimer's.

114
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:19,400
Don't you want to find
whoever leaked the video?

115
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:24,840
There it is.

116
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:30,200
Now that's what I want to talk about.

117
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,440
So you'll help me now, dear?

118
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:36,800
No.

119
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,920
I'm doing this for Tuang.

120
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,520
Deal.

121
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,240
Deal. Deal.

122
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,560
I'm doing it for my son.

123
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:55,320
Fine. And I'll do it for mine.

124
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:00,120
Then give me Non's phone back.

125
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:02,480
I need all the information
about Non on that phone.

126
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,680
You deleted all the photos and videos?

127
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,240
Why would I keep them?

128
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,760
But wait…

129
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:30,920
Didn't you already save them all?

130
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:34,720
Careful. If anything else gets leaked,

131
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:37,080
you'll become a suspect, Tul.

132
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,360
What are you having?

133
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,440
Noodles.

134
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,480
- Looks yummy.
- Stop!

135
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,320
Come on. Don't be stingy.

136
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:26,560
Get your own.

137
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:31,760
- Hey!
- Girls, don't forget to blow on your food,

138
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,680
or you'll get burned.

139
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:41,120
She'll never get lost on the way home

140
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,000
with that map on her face.

141
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,560
That's hilarious!

142
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:50,400
What's your problem?
Can't you shut the fuck up?

143
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,920
Bitch. You want some?

144
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,680
Yeah, come on!

145
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:57,376
What's wrong with what she said?
Your sister's face is all scarred up.

146
00:11:57,400 --> 00:12:00,000
- Is she wrong, huh?
- That's enough.

147
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,520
- Come on!
- Let's go.

148
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,080
Let's go, Non.

149
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:16,800
Stop it.

150
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:25,816
WHAT ARE YOU UPSET ABOUT?
CAN'T WE JUST TALK?

151
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,880
So what?

152
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,240
I'm sorry.

153
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,280
If you hadn't protected me,

154
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:37,920
you wouldn't be going through this.
I'm so sorry.

155
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:42,880
Stop apologizing. It's annoying.

156
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,800
How many times do I have to tell you
it's not your fault?

157
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:49,120
It's Marisa and Tulya's fault. Those bitches!

158
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:53,120
WE NEED TO GET OUR REVENGE.
WE'LL DRAG THE PORNHOVAS TO HELL WITH US

159
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,000
MARISA PORNHOVA

160
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:40,960
TULYA PORNHOVA

161
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:50,120
If you don't want to feel guilty
for the rest of your life,

162
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:56,120
you have to avenge Mom and me.

163
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,720
Okay.

164
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:06,640
I'll do it for you and Mom.

165
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,280
Why did you want to meet here?

166
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,480
You said you're not a believer.

167
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:22,360
Church isn't just for believers.

168
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,840
Non-believers can come, too, right?

169
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,760
If that's all you wanted to say, I'm leaving.

170
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:29,840
Okay, okay.

171
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,280
From what I've heard,

172
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:36,080
there were more than two people at the scene.

173
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,960
One of them was your grandmother.

174
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,600
And there was someone else.

175
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,440
Since that day,

176
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,360
the case hasn't gone anywhere.

177
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:51,640
The people who were there
are still walking around freely.

178
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,360
Who are you talking about?

179
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:59,040
Your mom and your grandma.

180
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,600
Seriously,

181
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:05,360
why did you try to get close to me?

182
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,920
What do you want?

183
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,440
What's your relationship with Nalin?

184
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,960
It's nothing.

185
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:20,640
I'm just saying the law here sucks.

186
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:24,480
Unless you're rich and powerful,
like your mom and grandma.

187
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:27,400
And your mom's a lawyer.

188
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,520
She's obviously helping your grandma.

189
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:32,000
My mom helped her because I asked her to.

190
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,440
She'd never break the law.

191
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,360
Really?

192
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,640
What's so funny?

193
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,080
I think your grandma

194
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:44,600
is covering for someone.

195
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,320
Who?

196
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:52,880
Who would be in big trouble
if Non were still alive?

197
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:01,360
You went from divorcing your cheating husband

198
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:06,160
to helping his mom
catch whoever killed his lover?

199
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,840
I'll get it.

200
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,520
I didn't know you were coming.

201
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:33,160
Tuang.

202
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:37,440
I'll leave you two to it. I'm heading out.

203
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:42,760
Can I stay with you tonight?

204
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,200
Of course.

205
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:47,360
Have you eaten?

206
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:51,120
Okay, honey. I'll make you something.

207
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:29,240
Where's the victim's phone?

208
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:31,680
The police mentioned evidence on the news,

209
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:33,680
but not a phone.

210
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:33,240
And they said the CCTV was broken.

211
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:36,040
Why do the cameras always break
whenever something happens?

212
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,920
Don't you think that's strange?

213
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:42,320
What's on your mind, honey?

214
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:45,120
Why are you staying here tonight?

215
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:48,800
Mom…

216
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,520
Do you think…

217
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,200
Dad killed Nalin?

218
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:56,400
I mean, Non.

219
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,120
Why would you say that?

220
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,160
What's on your mind?

221
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:06,600
Listen to me.

222
00:19:07,280 --> 00:19:10,080
I think your dad may have been framed.

223
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:15,280
Do you want him to go to prison
for something he didn't do?

224
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,680
Tell me,

225
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:25,720
why do you think he did it?

226
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:29,800
It just occurred to me.

227
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,240
I saw Dad leave home that night.

228
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,640
Grandma even hurried after him.

229
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:39,320
I also saw…

230
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:43,520
Non's phone and the DVR in a box.

231
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:47,400
Is that why you came here?

232
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:52,920
Don't worry about any of this.

233
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,000
I'll find the killer as soon as I can.

234
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,720
And don't tell anyone about this.

235
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,640
Not about the phone or the DVR.

236
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,240
Do you know who did it yet?

237
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:18,600
EDEN GALLERY

238
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:21,120
Ugh. What now?

239
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:24,040
Non's emails. I found them on the phone.

240
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:26,880
What about them?

241
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,720
Just read them first, then ask.

242
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:32,720
Tell me what they say first.

243
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:34,400
I'll decide if they're worth reading.

244
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,600
Are we actually going to work together?

245
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,640
Was she emailing herself?

246
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:52,520
That's what I thought at first.

247
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:53,760
But no.

248
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:57,520
It only looked that way.

249
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:59,640
The pronouns switch

250
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,520
between "I" and "you."

251
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,760
And I noticed

252
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:06,360
they change with the tone.

253
00:21:07,080 --> 00:21:08,800
Look at this part.

254
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:11,560
They call themselves the older sibling.

255
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,520
"Trust me, Lin."

256
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:20,320
Those siblings were using the same account?

257
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:24,240
Let's take turns reading

258
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:25,400
from the beginning.

259
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:37,840
"That bitch Tulya."

260
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,640
I'm just reading what's written.

261
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:47,080
"That bitch Tulya's back from England
with her husband and son."

262
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:50,360
"I've befriended her son through gaming."

263
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:56,800
"I heard they're holding an art auction."

264
00:21:56,880 --> 00:22:00,000
"Watch out for Marisa.
That bitch is a hellspawn."

265
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,600
I'm just reading it.

266
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:08,040
"Make the two of them fight.

267
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:10,440
Turn their home into hell."

268
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:16,240
"Saw them fighting at the gallery
about Tuang. So fucking satisfying."

269
00:22:18,840 --> 00:22:24,760
SO FUCKING SATISFYING

270
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:29,080
GET CHRIS NEXT. MAKE HIM YOUR BITCH

271
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:34,480
