404
00:34:21,720 --> 00:34:23,840
Have you forgotten everything?

405
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:27,840
Have you forgotten what they did to us?

406
00:34:28,200 --> 00:34:30,600
Right? Have you?

407
00:34:31,520 --> 00:34:32,680
