439
00:37:46,320 --> 00:37:47,680
I'm hurting too!

440
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,120
Will they know?

441
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:53,280
Lin…

442
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:57,400
I don't know what'll happen next,

443
00:37:58,400 --> 00:38:00,560
