452
00:39:30,080 --> 00:39:30,960
Chris…

453
00:39:31,040 --> 00:39:32,360
Shut up!

454
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:33,640
Chris…

455
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:40,560
If I could ask God to take your life,

456
00:39:41,080 --> 00:39:42,400
