495
00:41:36,160 --> 00:41:38,240
- Listen to me.
- No! I'm going to Mom.

496
00:41:39,120 --> 00:41:40,320
Don't, Lin!

497
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,400
- No!
- Lin.

498
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:43,000
