500
00:41:57,680 --> 00:41:58,800
Non?

501
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,280
I'm sorry.

502
00:42:01,600 --> 00:42:02,600
Non…

503
00:42:07,640 --> 00:42:08,720
Non!

504
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:14,560
I'm okay. I'm okay.

505
00:42:15,080 --> 00:42:16,440
It's okay, Lin.

506
00:42:17,760 --> 00:42:19,000
I'm sorry.

507
00:42:19,080 --> 00:42:22,600
It's okay. Don't cry. It's okay.

508
00:42:25,640 --> 00:42:26,960
Non!

509
00:42:28,960 --> 00:42:30,680
Non!

510
00:42:51,680 --> 00:42:53,200
Non…

511
00:44:06,760 --> 00:44:08,160
I didn't mean it.

512
00:44:10,560 --> 00:44:11,840
You did this to yourself.

513
00:44:14,640 --> 00:44:16,560
You loved Chris more than me.

514
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:43,840
There's a dead body under God's hand,
waiting for His confession.

515
00:44:43,920 --> 00:44:45,960
It doesn't matter who in your family did it.

516
00:44:46,040 --> 00:44:49,200
It could be your dad,
your grandma, or even your maid,

517
00:44:49,280 --> 00:44:51,000
