518
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:52,400
My mom never breaks the law.

519
00:44:52,480 --> 00:44:56,280
Maybe a person like Marisa Pornhova
should get a taste of prison.

520
00:44:56,360 --> 00:44:58,480
You have awakened a demon.

521
00:44:58,560 --> 00:45:00,640
Now you should pray to your God.

522
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:02,960
Let's give up on revenge.

523
00:45:03,040 --> 00:45:04,560
